ty":"e69467e64d33602aae1040a03324d8ac9bc3f2a668325017bbcff78dae4f0160","logical_entry_identity":"6f0cddd500cb9f6d7ecde4f213716076c8eb1f50949aa2b9cf43321d1be58a38","normalized_path":"mod-tome.lua","source":"After fighting back the other races we began to build and prosper. Finally we had our own towns and cities, and we began to advance our own abilities. Though battles were still ongoing at our borders we were free to thrive and prosper.\n\nBut then the accursed Shaloren mages began experimenting with Sher'Tul ruins. Oh what a dark and terrible a day it was for our race! The Spellblaze massacred our people. Earthquakes tore up our new-built towns, fires raged over old and young alike, and the whole world was turned to turmoil. Afterwards disease and blight ravaged our people, utterly ruining all the progress we had made.\n\nOnly the strongest of us lived through the dark times that followed. We fled east, back to our dark and hidden places, but our people swore terrible oaths of vengeance on the races that had brought such bloody ruin upon us.","source_tag":"_t","target":"在击退其他种族之后，我们开始建设家园、繁衍昌盛。我们终于拥有了自己的城镇与城市，并开始提升自身的能力。尽管边境上依然战事不断，我们仍得以自由地繁荣兴盛。\n\n然而，那些该死的永恒精灵法师开始拿夏·图尔废墟进行实验。哦，对我族而言那是多么黑暗而可怕的一天！魔法大爆炸屠杀了我们的人民。地震撕裂了我们新建的城镇，烈火吞噬了老幼妇孺，整个世界都陷入了混乱。随后，疾病与枯萎疫病肆虐我族，将我们取得的一切成果彻底摧毁。\n\n随后到来的黑暗时期里，唯有我们当中最强壮者才得以幸存。我们向东逃亡，回到了黑暗隐秘的避难所，但我们的族人发下了残酷的复仇誓言，誓要让那些将如此血腥毁灭降临于我们的种族血债血偿。"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"7a9ac73e738b4002e0c9887b473f836e7a873292b59060fdd3ddd9cbb2415412","component":"tome","entry_revision_identity":"e6976768f97b261a317d34b20fbdd66a6f42788687a1c448ec78f729eb5b8bd7","logical_entry_identity":"26d77e64b11394d947df3f03ab58775e65b5f6e8b5c9a54753592669ffcec947","normalized_path":"mod-tome.lua","source":"#{bold}#%s's mind surges with critical power!#{normal}#","source_tag":"logSeen","target":"#{bold}#%s的精神攻击造成了致命一击！#{normal}#"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"275b852621600237dc5165ea607aa7036d6992b2695486ab68ab4b526cfe7dab","component":"tome","entry_revision_